Each is an R condition carrying the class shown and \code{mzlib_error}; see \code{\link{mzlib_error}}.

\describe{
\item{\code{mzlib_usage_error} (usage)}{\code{--peptides} or \code{--basis} missing; \code{--basis} not msms_only or mbr_kept; \code{--protein-groups}, \code{--samples}, \code{--out} or \code{--responses-out} given without a value; a file not found, or not the table type named; \code{--out} or \code{--responses-out} not ending in .tsv; \code{--min-peptides} below 1 or not an integer}
